WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.822
Instagram par anjaan login dikha? Ya

00:00:02.822 --> 00:00:05.523
Facebook se aise messages ja rahe hain jo

00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:08.144
aapne nahi bheje? Chaliye, pehle alert

00:00:08.144 --> 00:00:09.336
check karte hain.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.087
Apne account ki recovery ke liye hum

00:00:12.087 --> 00:00:14.498
official steps samjhate hain. Apna

00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:17.150
password ya OTP kisi se share na karein.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.068
Phir two-step verification on karein aur

00:00:20.068 --> 00:00:22.720
login kiye hue devices dekhein. Phone mein

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.887
anjaan app ya scam link ka asar bhi check karte hain.

00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:28.948
Files nahi mil rahi? Pehle backup dekhein.

00:00:28.948 --> 00:00:31.367
Phir device ki haalat ke hisaab se data

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.635
recovery ke options samajhte hain.

00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:36.510
Digital forensics mein, aapki permission

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.834
se records surakshit rakhte hain. Unki

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:41.370
timeline dekh kar samajhte hain ki kya hua.

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:44.354
Account, phone ya data mein dikkat hai?

00:00:44.354 --> 00:00:46.998
Neeche contact karein. Bas batayein ki

00:00:46.998 --> 00:00:48.680
aapne kya dekha, aur kab.
